-- hand from the text.

§ `ss 2, 4(1), 6`

`unlicensed maid agency` MEANS Actor WITH
    `runs an agency or registry for employing others` IS TRUE
    `does employment work in Singapore` IS TRUE
    `recruits solely for its own employment` IS FALSE
    `is wholly maintained or managed by a Government department` IS FALSE
    `holds a licence` IS FALSE
    `is registered personnel acting as such` IS FALSE
    `is exempted by order` IS FALSE

